From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 07:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: only include <fmt/format.h> when fmt is enabled

The check was inverted: with PRISM_DISABLE_FMT=1 (as Neon, Aurora and the
CryptixOS userland build Prism) Formatter.hpp included <fmt/format.h>,
which is not installed, and failed to compile.
---
 Source/Prism/String/Formatter.hpp | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Source/Prism/String/Formatter.hpp b/Source/Prism/String/Formatter.hpp
index 1bce539..7a5e94e 100644
--- a/Source/Prism/String/Formatter.hpp
+++ b/Source/Prism/String/Formatter.hpp
@@ -11,9 +11,8 @@
 #include <Prism/String/FormatString.hpp>
 #include <Prism/String/StringBuilder.hpp>
 
-#if PRISM_DISABLE_FMT != 0
+#if PRISM_DISABLE_FMT == 0
     #include <fmt/format.h>
-#else
 #endif
 
 namespace Prism
-- 
2.43.0

